    "Condition : 4 - All servicing and delivery activities associated with the development hereby permitted shall be undertaken only from the existing designated areas serving the existing restaurant building and the wider Leisure West complex, and shall only take place during the approved servicing and delivery hours. Any storage of goods, materials, equipment, waste, packaging and any other items associated with the use shall be confined to the designated storage areas serving the restaurant.\r\nReason: To safeguard amenity, pedestrian safety, access arrangements and the efficient operation of the wider Leisure West complex, in accordance with Policies CC2 and EC2 of the Hounslow Local Plan and Policies T2 and T4 of the London Plan.\r\n"
